[Unit]
Description=Hourly fleet judge on Kimi K3 (pi cursor/kimi-k3-max), offset :30 UTC (fleet-ops#4455 third POV) — cadence set from measured $/run; initial hourly per Nish 2026-09-08 'use generously to use up the $400 before sub expires'.
